{"3905450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "WheelMates", "steam_appid": 3905450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5108990], "detailed_description": "<h1>Friend's Pass</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905450/extras/40abdcf7e935a428ff714060844ef503.avif?t=1788276957\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905450/extras_big/40abdcf7e935a428ff714060844ef503.webp?t=1788276957 width=1560 height=756 /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and a friend answer a call for help from a professor who has mysteriously disappeared. Take control of two tiny RC cars, drive through his maze-like home laboratory, overcome oversized obstacles, and uncover the strange experiments he left behind.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905450/extras/df544c536c6efe1818f5dbc210ee607f.poster.avif?t=1788276957\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905450/extras/df544c536c6efe1818f5dbc210ee607f.webm?t=1788276957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905450/extras/df544c536c6efe1818f5dbc210ee607f.mp4?t=1788276957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every room turns the house into a playground for two tiny RC cars. Race across shelves, drift through cluttered desks, explore every location and piece together what really happened inside.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905450/extras/4a099f717fd2b704ba9f6f6bb0d513de.poster.avif?t=1788276957\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905450/extras/4a099f717fd2b704ba9f6f6bb0d513de.webm?t=1788276957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905450/extras/4a099f717fd2b704ba9f6f6bb0d513de.mp4?t=1788276957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this co-op journey your progress depends on working together. Solve puzzles and overcome challenges that require communication, timing, and both players doing their part.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905450/extras/ae48c55aaefb84aae1fc54a29d0e2625.poster.avif?t=1788276957\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905450/extras/ae48c55aaefb84aae1fc54a29d0e2625.webm?t=1788276957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905450/extras/ae48c55aaefb84aae1fc54a29d0e2625.mp4?t=1788276957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your RC cars with rope-swings, magnetic wheels, magnet grabs and other power-ups. Each new gadget opens up fresh way to exploration of the professor’s home.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905450/extras/e2266d452c43a00b12dbf8f26afd3868.poster.avif?t=1788276957\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905450/extras/e2266d452c43a00b12dbf8f26afd3868.webm?t=1788276957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905450/extras/e2266d452c43a00b12dbf8f26afd3868.mp4?t=1788276957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The house keeps opening up as you progress. Unlock hidden rooms and move through familiar places in new ways. </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and a friend answer a call for help from a professor who has mysteriously disappeared. Take control of two tiny RC cars, drive through his maze-like home laboratory, overcome oversized obstacles, and uncover the strange experiments he left behind.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905450/extras/df544c536c6efe1818f5dbc210ee607f.poster.avif?t=1788276957\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905450/extras/df544c536c6efe1818f5dbc210ee607f.webm?t=1788276957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905450/extras/df544c536c6efe1818f5dbc210ee607f.mp4?t=1788276957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every room turns the house into a playground for two tiny RC cars. Race across shelves, drift through cluttered desks, explore every location and piece together what really happened inside.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905450/extras/4a099f717fd2b704ba9f6f6bb0d513de.poster.avif?t=1788276957\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905450/extras/4a099f717fd2b704ba9f6f6bb0d513de.webm?t=1788276957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3